      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#12 - the sewer people\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1393,1416]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You follow the shadows to spy on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1416,1449]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "them. Make a L5 Stealth roll. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1449,1486]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "succeed, you are not seen and you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1486,1520]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may steal d6 Food point from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1520,1553]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sewer people. If you fail, you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1553,1588]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "caught in the act and the sewer\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1588,1620]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "dwelling sub-humans will try to kill\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1620,1657]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1657,1662]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random item in the hut\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1662,1685]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Chainsaw.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1685,1697]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2-3 Hammer, nails, insecticide.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1697,1729]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4 Knife, d6 Food points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1729,1754]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5 Rope, d6 Food points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1754,1778]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 Shotgun with 2d6 shells.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,1778,1805]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6+3 sewer people, L2, 1 Life,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,22,53]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage 1. Loot: 6 Food points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,53,84]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may bribe your way out of this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,84,119]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fight by succeeding an L5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,119,145]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma roll (roll at +1 if you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,145,183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma, and +2 if you have it at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,183,218]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert level) and giving them all of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,218,255]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your Food, as long as you have at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,255,289]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "least 1 Food point. If you give 6 or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,289,326]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "more Food points, gain a +1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,326,354]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-012:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "modifier to the Charisma roll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,354,385]]"
    }
  ],
